### Concrete Recommendations

**Priority 1 — Add assertions to the 5 assertion-free tests:**

```csharp
// GetUsers_DoesNotThrow → verify returned data
var users = client.GetUsers();
Assert.IsNotNull(users);
Assert.IsTrue(users.Count > 0, "Expected at least one user");

// GetUserById_DoesNotThrow → verify correct user returned
var user = client.GetUserById(1);
Assert.IsNotNull(user);
Assert.AreEqual(1, user.Id);

// CreateUser_DoesNotThrow → verify creation result
var result = client.CreateUser("test@example.com", "TestUser");
Assert.IsNotNull(result);
Assert.AreEqual("test@example.com", result.Email);

// DeleteUser_DoesNotThrow → verify deletion effect or response
